    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>AmirMušić</strong><h1>我是如何仅用 1 张图片和 GPT-v2 打造 Gucci x Crocs 营销活动的</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一天内，这个 Gucci x Crocs 概念获得了数十万的浏览量、2000+收藏和数百个问题：</span></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如何制作这个\n哪里可以找到这些提示词？</span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">答案是：</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> 此时此刻 </span><span data-text=\"true\">.\n向下滚动并获取这篇文章中的所有资源 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">👇</span></span></span></p>\n<blockquote><p>你终于可以用 GPT 图像 2 创建真实的营销活动了——从视觉参考到整个活动系统\n\n通过良好的提示序列，你可以快速进行一次性头脑风暴并将其转化为幻灯片，向老板或客户展示——并且它已经有80-90%的内容准备好展示了\n\n这个</p><footer>— AmirMušić</footer><p><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2048477363575623926\">https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2048477363575623926</a></p><div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1872350781686321152/P-st4llY_x96.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" /><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG2mo3zaoAAHty4?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG2muJZbIAAVN1s?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG2mxpDa8AAVs8h?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG2m0F4aoAAoShI?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /><img src=\"chrome-extension://jfphcjkiccfhcmggdncpidahnkfpngfa/blueicon.jpg\" alt=\"Download\" /></div></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">*本文由 </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@LTXStudio\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@LTXStudio</span></a><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"> 赞助。感谢 LTX 团队支持这篇文章以及我为你所做的工作。</span></div></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">理念：图像到引擎</span></span></h1>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span data-text=\"true\">当我还是个孩子的时候，我就喜欢宏大的想法。\n随着我长大，我意识到不可能把我所有的想法都付诸实践。\n我的人生不会有足够的时间去做那件事...</span></font></font></font></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">真正的精通需要数年时间来磨练，而远见则需要数十年才能成熟。\n接受那件事很令人难过。所以，我表现得比较低调。</span></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">但是在2026年，一切都随着人工智能变了。</span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">我曾想过：\n<span data-text=\"true\">“如果我能拍摄一张我喜爱的图片，并且\n→<span style=\"font-style: italic;\"> 提取最吸引我的主要部分</span>\n<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">把它转化为一个完全不同的想法？</span><span data-text=\"true\">”</span></span></font></font></font></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">我运行了一个测试，而且它成功了！让我演示一下如何：\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">重复以下步骤 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">👇</span></span></span></font></font></font></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHj0hl9XEAMhLww?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我为你构建了一个包含所有提示和逻辑的即用型流程：</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它在我本文末尾的 LTX 项目中。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">向下滚动并立即获取它 - 免费。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你需要的4个工具</span></span></h1>\n<ol><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">Pinterest/Behance - 用于视觉灵感和参考，</font></font></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ChatGPT</span><span data-text=\"true\"> - 将你的图像转化为基础品牌板，</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">LTX Flows</span><span data-text=\"true\"> - 获取我的基础销售漏斗 + 扩展你的营销活动。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">以下提示 </span><span data-text=\"true\"> - 以确保一切正常运行且外观出色。</span></li></ol>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">向下滚动，获取所有提示和免费礼物\n在文章末尾等你。\n完全准备好的 LTX 项目链接也在那里。</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHj4VYEXAAgeyIU?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我的创意方向逻辑</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">创意指导逻辑</span></span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这正是我作为 CD 时的想法：</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">发现了一张图片，它的氛围吸引住了我</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提取了其创意系统（下方提示）</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">想象中的奢侈时尚 × 街头服饰张力</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">围绕它构建愿景（借助 ChatGPT）</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">使产品成为主角</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在所有资产中建立一致的视觉语言</span></li></ol>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这个思维框架能帮助你更轻松地创建更强大的设计系统。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">💡 我恳请你了解更多关于传统 CD 和创意营销框架的知识——届时你的技能将借助 AI 而突飞猛进。</font></font></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHj1aucWgAYSVUT?format=png&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">以下是我使用的所有提示\n按照确切的顺序</span></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">参考解构</span></span></h1>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">步骤 0:\n<span data-text=\"true\">我们从参考图像中提取整体风格 - 并将其转化为一个 Brandboard - 作为 GPT2 的指导原则，以便在其基础上构建另一个概念。</span></font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">上传你的图片到 LTX Flows 中 + 在提示节点中添加这个提示词 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">👇</span></span></span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示:</span></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">You are a world-class Creative Director and Brand Designer working at a top-tier agency.\n\nUsing the provided reference image as the source of truth, create a clean 4:3 visual brand board.\n\nDo NOT copy the reference directly. Extract and rebuild its underlying creative system:\n\n* core idea and creative tension\n* color and material language\n* typography direction\n* image and composition logic\n* signature visual device\n* layout/grid system\n* scalable campaign applications\n\nThe output must be a polished visual brand board, not a text-heavy document.\n\nDesign direction:\n\n* premium editorial layout\n* clear modular grid\n* strong hero visual area\n* limited, readable labels only\n* large visual tiles\n* minimal micro-copy\n* no overcrowding\n* no overlapping text on active backgrounds\n* clean margins and consistent spacing\n\nThe board should feel like a professional agency campaign direction slide: visual, structured, immediately understandable, and ready to use as the foundation for a full brand campaign.\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkG_NGWAAAJDwc?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你在 Flows 中的入门第一步 - 这是你如何通过简单步骤搭建生产级设计流水线。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">访问流程</span></h2>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\">前往 </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://amirmushich.link/AMIR-LTX\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://amirmushich.link/AMIR-LTX</span></a></div></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">点击“生成图像” - 然后你将进入 Gen Space</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在 Gen Space 中，顶部中央你会找到 Flows 选项卡</span></li></ol>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">PROMPT 2. 构建你的概念</span></span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">让我们将我们的品牌融入创意流程与逻辑中。</span></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">&gt; AI 从我们之前的步骤中带入系统,\n&gt; applies it to our new brand - using the prompt below:</font></font></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkI6VFXsAUoeIu?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在下面的提示中，我将[INSERT ANY BRAND HERE]更改为[GUCCI x CROCS]</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkKbFJW4AQXDiA?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在这个阶段，你开始掌控美学与创作逻辑</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示:</span></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">recreate the whole campaign document for [INSERT ANY BRAND HERE] \nimaginary collab campaign, \nusing the source image I provided as a material &amp; vibe reference, \nbut rebuild it completely according to new brands' visual aesthetic\nand brand guidelines, \nbe especially careful with brands' fonts consistency and accuracy</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示 3. 创建资源</span></span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">现在，我们将创建一套品牌化的视觉资产。</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">帖子,</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">横幅,</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">原型</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">特写,</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">详情</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我们希望看到全局并锁定方向。\n一旦你熟悉它，我们就准备继续前进。\n我们稍后将创建实际的资产</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkLb9qWwAUYYRx?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示:</span></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Now create me a moodboard of actual visual assets for this campaign:\n* digital banners, \n* social media banners &amp; posts, \n* ad materials, \n* aesthetical assets \netc\n\navoid overlapping text layers over active backgrounds \n\nmake 30% less images, but make them tighter \nand looking more like a bento grid\n</code></pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">注意：</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">GPT-v2 可以在模型的面部叠加文字——这看起来很糟糕\n</span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">\n在下方的额外 LTX 项目中找到\"补丁提示\"以修复此问题 👇</span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHpky-WWkAQvMLJ?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">更多提示和工作流程 - 在我下面的 LTX 项目中</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示 4. 锁定视野</span></span></h1>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">一旦你觉得方向正确，就把它记录在 Brief Slide 中。</font></font></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">那很有用</span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">对你、对 AI 以及潜在客户都有用 </span><span data-text=\"true\">——因为现在每个人都有了</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">清晰的概念和愿景。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我个人从这些幻灯片中学到了很多——从创意巧思到关于品牌、营销和设计的基础见解。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">提示很简单但很强大 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">👇</span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkObh6XsAUh0lk?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">简单的提示将你的方向转化为愿景</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示:</span></span></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">now create me a slide with this campaign's \n* brief, \n* idea \n* and goals\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示 5. 关键视觉元素</span></span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">一旦我们的战略和设计愿景确定后，\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n是时候创建关键视觉元素（KV）了。</span></p>\n<blockquote><p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">关键视觉是 </span><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;\"> 活动的主要视觉载体 </span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">。\n它设定了氛围、理念、颜色、构图和第一印象。</span></font></font></font></p></blockquote>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">KVs 帮助品牌每次都能让策略看起来新颖、贴切且以销售为导向。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">让我们创建它们 - 提示如下 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f447.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">👇</span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HHkS4rgXwAMeg4o?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示:</span></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">now create a clean image slide with \na photo scene of campaign-relevant characters \npositioned in  a campaign-relevant surrounding \nwith campaign slogan positioned on top of the photograph \nin a fashion-magazine typography design style and level\n\nact as a world class art director \npresenting the campaign with a single visual slide:\nthe key visual that deserves to be on the first page of \nForbes or Esquire magazines\n\nI don't need an overwhelmed tech slide, \nI need a cover art for the whole campaign</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX Studio 工作流</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我在一个 LTX 项目中构建了整个活动 - 它对所有人开放</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">以下是 LTX 如何一键缩放 100 多个资产的方法：</span></p>\n<blockquote><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">构建你的 Flow 流水线\n2. 复制粘贴到那里\n3. 调整1个提示词\n4. 运行整个引擎\n5. 观看魔法发生</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作原理如下：</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2052070389321203904\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2052051745136611330/img/O89IffGO6-Sz-MCL.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2052070389321203904\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2052051745136611330/img/O89IffGO6-Sz-MCL.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">额外资产</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">请务必确保，在每篇文章中你都会获得我亲自制作的奖励资产和礼物。今天也一样 </span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f60c.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">😌</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">带上你所有的东西：</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f381.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">🎁</span></span></span><span data-text=\"true\"> 全 LTX 项目</span></h2>\n<p><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://amirmushich.link/gucci-crocs\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://amirmushich.link/gucci-crocs</span></a><span data-text=\"true\">\n整个活动已经以节点形式为您构建完成（提示 + 逻辑 + 缩放流程）</span></div></p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f381.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🎁</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span><span data-text=\"true\"> 精英字体生成器</span></h2>\n<p><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2026693633794076892\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2026693633794076892</span></a></div></p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f381.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🎁</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span><span data-text=\"true\">80+ LinkedIn 搜索查询</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">寻找合作伙伴和在人工智能领域工作:\n→ </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://amirmushich.link/search_queries\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://amirmushich.link/search_queries</span></a></div></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最终</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是一个类似于我目前为一些客户使用的流程。\n现在它是你的了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">别忘了：</span></span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">保存这篇文章。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\">关注 </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@AmirMushich\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@AmirMushich</span></a></div></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">为了更多的设计/生产分解和工作流程。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">你会先为哪个品牌策划活动？</span><span style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/svg/1f440.svg&quot;); background-size: 1em 1em; padding: 0.15em; background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"clip-path: circle(0% at 50% 50%);\"><span data-text=\"true\">👀</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在评论区留下你的结果 - 我会引用一些我喜欢的内容。</span></span></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p></div></article><hr/><h3>热门回复</h3><div class=\"tw-replies\"><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Apr 26</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 2.3K · 💬 257</span><p>你终于可以用 GPT 图像 2 创建真实的营销活动了——从视觉参考到整个活动系统<br><br>通过良好的提示序列，你可以快速进行一次性头脑风暴并将其转化为幻灯片，向老板或客户展示——并且它已经有80-90%的内容准备好展示了<br><br>这个</p></div></div>",
    "pageContent": "一天内，这个 Gucci x Crocs 概念获得了数十万的浏览量、2000+收藏和数百个问题：\n如何制作这个\n哪里可以找到这些提示词？\n答案是： 此时此刻 .\n向下滚动并获取这篇文章中的所有资源 👇\nAmirMušić\n@AmirMushich\n·\nApr 26\n你终于可以用 GPT 图像 2 创建真实的营销活动了——从视觉参考到整个活动系统 通过良好的提示序列，你可以快速进行一次性头脑风暴并将其转化为幻灯片，向老板或客户展示——并且它已经有80-90%的内容准备好展示了 这个\nShow more\n257\n251\n2.3K\n471K\n*本文由 @LTXStudio 赞助。感谢 LTX 团队支持这篇文章以及我为你所做的工作。\n理念：图像到引擎\n当我还是个孩子的时候，我就喜欢宏大的想法。\n随着我长大，我意识到不可能把我所有的想法都付诸实践。\n我的人生不会有足够的时间去做那件事...\n真正的精通需要数年时间来磨练，而远见则需要数十年才能成熟。\n接受那件事很令人难过。所以，我表现得比较低调。\n但是在2026年，一切都随着人工智能变了。\n我曾想过：\n“如果我能拍摄一张我喜爱的图片，并且\n→ 提取最吸引我的主要部分\n把它转化为一个完全不同的想法？”\n我为你构建了一个包含所有提示和逻辑的即用型流程：\n它在我本文末尾的 LTX 项目中。\n向下滚动并立即获取它 - 免费。\n你需要的4个工具\nChatGPT - 将你的图像转化为基础品牌板，\nLTX Flows - 获取我的基础销售漏斗 + 扩展你的营销活动。\n以下提示 - 以确保一切正常运行且外观出色。\n向下滚动，获取所有提示和免费礼物\n在文章末尾等你。\n完全准备好的 LTX 项目链接也在那里。\n我的创意方向逻辑\n创意指导逻辑\n这正是我作为 CD 时的想法：\n发现了一张图片，它的氛围吸引住了我\n提取了其创意系统（下方提示）\n想象中的奢侈时尚 × 街头服饰张力\n围绕它构建愿景（借助 ChatGPT）\n使产品成为主角\n在所有资产中建立一致的视觉语言\n这个思维框架能帮助你更轻松地创建更强大的设计系统。\n以下是我使用的所有提示\n按照确切的顺序\n参考解构\n上传你的图片到 LTX Flows 中 + 在提示节点中添加这个提示词 👇\n提示:\nYou are a world-class Creative Director and Brand Designer working at a top-tier agency. Using the provided reference image as the source of truth, create a clean 4:3 visual brand board. Do NOT copy the reference directly. Extract and rebuild its underlying creative system: * core idea and creative tension\n* color and material language\n* typography direction\n* image and composition logic\n* signature visual device\n* layout/grid system\n* scalable campaign applications The output must be a polished visual brand board, not a text-heavy document. Design direction: * premium editorial layout\n* clear modular grid\n* strong hero visual area\n* limited, readable labels only\n* large visual tiles\n* minimal micro-copy\n* no overcrowding\n* no overlapping text on active backgrounds\n* clean margins and consistent spacing The board should feel like a professional agency campaign direction slide: visual, structured, immediately understandable, and ready to use as the foundation for a full brand campaign. 你在 Flows 中的入门第一步 - 这是你如何通过简单步骤搭建生产级设计流水线。\n访问流程\n前往 https://amirmushich.link/AMIR-LTX\n点击“生成图像” - 然后你将进入 Gen Space\n在 Gen Space 中，顶部中央你会找到 Flows 选项卡\nPROMPT 2. 构建你的概念\n让我们将我们的品牌融入创意流程与逻辑中。\n在下面的提示中，我将[INSERT ANY BRAND HERE]更改为[GUCCI x CROCS]\n在这个阶段，你开始掌控美学与创作逻辑\n提示:\nrecreate the whole campaign document for [INSERT ANY BRAND HERE] imaginary collab campaign, using the source image I provided as a material & vibe reference, but rebuild it completely according to new brands' visual aesthetic\nand brand guidelines, be especially careful with brands' fonts consistency and accuracy\n提示 3. 创建资源\n现在，我们将创建一套品牌化的视觉资产。\n帖子,\n横幅,\n原型\n特写,\n详情\n我们希望看到全局并锁定方向。\n一旦你熟悉它，我们就准备继续前进。\n我们稍后将创建实际的资产\n提示:\nNow create me a moodboard of actual visual assets for this campaign:\n* digital banners, * social media banners & posts, * ad materials, * aesthetical assets etc avoid overlapping text layers over active backgrounds make 30% less images, but make them tighter and looking more like a bento grid 注意：\nGPT-v2 可以在模型的面部叠加文字——这看起来很糟糕 在下方的额外 LTX 项目中找到\"补丁提示\"以修复此问题 👇\n更多提示和工作流程 - 在我下面的 LTX 项目中\n提示 4. 锁定视野\n那很有用对你、对 AI 以及潜在客户都有用 ——因为现在每个人都有了清晰的概念和愿景。\n我个人从这些幻灯片中学到了很多——从创意巧思到关于品牌、营销和设计的基础见解。\n提示很简单但很强大 👇\n简单的提示将你的方向转化为愿景\n提示:\nnow create me a slide with this campaign's * brief, * idea * and goals 提示 5. 关键视觉元素\n一旦我们的战略和设计愿景确定后， 是时候创建关键视觉元素（KV）了。\nKVs 帮助品牌每次都能让策略看起来新颖、贴切且以销售为导向。\n让我们创建它们 - 提示如下 👇\n提示:\nnow create a clean image slide with a photo scene of campaign-relevant characters positioned in a campaign-relevant surrounding with campaign slogan positioned on top of the photograph in a fashion-magazine typography design style and level act as a world class art director presenting the campaign with a single visual slide:\nthe key visual that deserves to be on the first page of Forbes or Esquire magazines I don't need an overwhelmed tech slide, I need a cover art for the whole campaign\nLTX Studio 工作流\n我在一个 LTX 项目中构建了整个活动 - 它对所有人开放\n以下是 LTX 如何一键缩放 100 多个资产的方法：\n构建你的 Flow 流水线\n2. 复制粘贴到那里\n3. 调整1个提示词\n4. 运行整个引擎\n5. 观看魔法发生\n工作原理如下：\n额外资产\n请务必确保，在每篇文章中你都会获得我亲自制作的奖励资产和礼物。今天也一样 😌\n带上你所有的东西：\n🎁 全 LTX 项目\nhttps://amirmushich.link/gucci-crocs\n整个活动已经以节点形式为您构建完成（提示 + 逻辑 + 缩放流程）\n🎁 精英字体生成器\nhttps://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2026693633794076892\n🎁 80+ LinkedIn 搜索查询\n寻找合作伙伴和在人工智能领域工作:\n→ https://amirmushich.link/search_queries\n最终\n这是一个类似于我目前为一些客户使用的流程。\n现在它是你的了。\n别忘了：\n保存这篇文章。\n关注 @AmirMushich\n为了更多的设计/生产分解和工作流程。\n你会先为哪个品牌策划活动？👀\n在评论区留下你的结果 - 我会引用一些我喜欢的内容。 \n---\n热门回复 (共 1 条):\n@Apr 26 (♥ 2.3K · 💬 257):\n你终于可以用 GPT 图像 2 创建真实的营销活动了——从视觉参考到整个活动系统\n\n通过良好的提示序列，你可以快速进行一次性头脑风暴并将其转化为幻灯片，向老板或客户展示——并且它已经有80-90%的内容准备好展示了\n\n这个\n"
  },
